---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Aura & Scape"
  description="How Aura & Scape handles your data, cookies, and privacy."
>
  <section class="page-hero bg-cream" aria-label="Privacy header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <p>Last updated: September 2025</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section bg-cream" aria-label="Privacy policy">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>What We Collect</h2>
        <p>We only collect information you choose to share with us through our contact form: your name, email address, phone number, and any details you include about your event.</p>

        <h2>How We Use It</h2>
        <p>Your information is used solely to respond to your inquiry and discuss your event. We do not sell, share, or distribute your personal data to third parties.</p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>This website uses a single cookie to remember your cookie consent preference (accept or decline). This cookie is stored locally in your browser and contains no personal information.</p>
        <p>We do not use tracking cookies, advertising cookies, or analytics tools that identify you.</p>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>Our contact form is powered by Formspree. When you submit the form, your data is transmitted to Formspree to deliver it to us. Formspree's own privacy policy applies to their handling of that data in transit.</p>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal data we hold about you by emailing hello@aurascape.in. We will respond within 7 days.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@aurascape.in">hello@aurascape.in</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
